# Scratch images and stray staleness reports that keep landing at the repo root.
# Both are throwaway output — the images are editing scratch, and the staleness
# reports are a snapshot of a moment, regenerated on demand rather than read
# back. They accumulated until `git status` was 32 lines of noise, which is how
# a real uncommitted change gets lost.
#
# NOT ignored, deliberately: docs/reports/ and docs/knowledge/, which hold real
# discovery output and knowledge entries. Ignoring those would mean work that
# can never be committed and quietly disappears.
*.png
knowledge-staleness-report-*.md
docs/knowledge-staleness-report-*.md

# Butter's call, 2026-08-24: these six specific files stop showing in git status.
# They stay ON DISK — ignored, not deleted — so nothing is lost, only untracked.
#
# Listed file-by-file rather than as docs/reports/ and docs/knowledge/, so a
# future report or knowledge entry still appears. Blanket-ignoring those
# directories would silently swallow every entry the knowledge service writes
# from here on.
docs/knowledge/conversation-add-caps-content-at-1500-chars-design-the-thread-post-don-t-discove.md
docs/knowledge/session-end-lands-on-implemented-done-needs-a-second-deliberate-call.md
docs/reports/companion-task-code-git-view-discovery.md
docs/reports/embedding-variant-migration-discovery.md
docs/reports/knowledge-staleness-2026-08-17.md
docs/reports/zalo-group-message-bridge-discovery.md
